OL,8,G0232 Tech Life
OL,9,     FLots of people make a living from
OL,10,     Fsocial media posts. But some have
OL,11,     Fbeen targeted by an international
OL,12,     Fextortion scheme. It involves a
OL,13,     Fflood of false copyright
OL,14,     Finfringement claims.
